Subject: [PATCH 2/2] =?UTF-8?q?fix:=20drop=20citations=20inside=20the=20ge?=
 =?UTF-8?q?nerator's=20bold=20[=D7=A1=D7=A2=D7=99=D7=A3=20X]=20division=20?=
 =?UTF-8?q?markers=20(Otzaria/otzaria#6075,=20#5927)?=
